# {{ project_name }} documentation

This page routes readers and agents to the page or evidence they need. Follow the row
that matches your topic and reader need; do not read the whole repository by default.
The toolkit's canonical evidence policy lives outside this subtree in
[.ai-docs/policy.md]({{ '../' * (docs_dir.count('/') + 1) }}.ai-docs/policy.md) and is not duplicated here.

## Routes

| Topic | Reader need/type | Audience | Path | Evidence entry point |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| Update or add documentation | How-to | Contributors and agents | [how-to/update-documentation.md](how-to/update-documentation.md) | [.ai-docs/policy.md]({{ '../' * (docs_dir.count('/') + 1) }}.ai-docs/policy.md) |
| Documentation rules, claim evidence, review outcomes | Reference | Contributors and reviewers | [reference/documentation-policy.md](reference/documentation-policy.md) | [.ai-docs/policy.md]({{ '../' * (docs_dir.count('/') + 1) }}.ai-docs/policy.md) |
